TI  - 39Ar-40Ar Geochronology and EBSD Analysis of Mylonite in Zanhuang Massif: Implications for Paleoproterozoic Tectono-Thermal Evolution of North China Craton
ST  - 赞皇地体糜棱岩 39Ar-40Ar 年代学及 EBSD 组构分析：对华北克拉通古元古代构造热演化过程的启示
PY  - 2025
T2  - Diqiu Kexue - Zhongguo Dizhi Daxue Xuebao/Earth Science - Journal of China University of Geosciences
VL  - 50
IS  - 4
SP  - 1273
