TI  - Integrated frequency ratio-analytical hierarchy and geospatial techniques-based earthquake risk assessment in mountainous cities: a case from the Northwestern Himalayas
PY  - 2025
T2  - Georisk
VL  - 19
IS  - 2
SP  - 389
