TI  - Refined Stochastic Source Modeling and Selection Method for Complex Fault Systems Considering Data Uncertainty: A Case Study of the 2019 Ridgecrest Earthquakes
PY  - 2025
T2  - Seismological Research Letters
VL  - 96
IS  - 6
SP  - 3329
