TI  - Seismic Behavior of Active Faults Through Multisource Optical Imagery: From Satellite to Drone Resolution (case study: The North Zanjan fault)
PY  - 2025
T2  - International Archives of the Photogrammetry, Remote Sensing and Spatial Information Sciences - ISPRS Archives
VL  - 48
IS  - G-2025
SP  - 9
