AD  - Ulugh Beg Astronomical Institute of Uzbekistan Academy of Sciences, 33 Astronomy Street, Tashkent, 100052, Uzbekistan
AD  - Tashkent State Technical University Named After Islam Karimov, 2 University Street, Tashkent, 100095, Uzbekistan
AD  - Ministry of Economy and Financial of the Republic Uzbekistan, Istiqlol street 29, 100017 Tashkent, Uzbekistan
