TI  - The 2021 Mw8.1 Kermadec Megathrust Earthquake: An Event Rupturing the Slab-Mantle Interface With Up-Dip High-Frequency Seismic Energy Radiation
PY  - 2025
T2  - Geophysical Research Letters
VL  - 52
IS  - 4
C7  - e2024GL113015
