TI  - LATE QUATERNARY ACTIVITY OF THE XIETONGMEN TO DENGMECUO SEGMENT ALONG THE XAINZA-DINGGYE RIFT IN SOUTHERN QINGHAI-XIZANG PLATEAU
PY  - 2025
T2  - Dizhen Dizhi
VL  - 47
IS  - 3
SP  - 718
